OL,3,GNEWSAFerry operator disappointed over
OL,4,Afunding decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FWyre Council and the company that runs
OL,7,Fthe Fleetwood to Knott End Ferry have
OL,8,Fboth said they are disappointed after
OL,9,Flearning Lancashire County Council will
OL,10,Fnot increase its funding for the
OL,11,Fservice.
OL,13,FFleetwood to Knott End Ferry Ltd said
OL,14,Fit had worked closely with councils and
OL,15,Fhad been "led to believe the service
OL,16,Fwas progressing towards a new
OL,17,Fcontract".
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
