OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFerry operator disappointed over
OL,4,Afunding decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FLancashire County Council is
OL,7,Fresponsible for the running costs but,
OL,8,Funder an agreement, has shared them
OL,9,Fwith Wyre Council, with each authority
OL,10,Fpaying half.
OL,12,FThe county council's cabinet member for
OL,13,Fhighways and transport, Warren
OL,14,FGoldsworthy, said more money for the
OL,15,Fferry would take funding away from
OL,16,Fother services.
